{
  "id": "design-system",
  "capability": "Shared UI component library",
  "description": "The @comfyorg/design-system package (the Reka-based primitives, media, charts, color picker, tags, modal layout, navigation, and generic common/ widgets) with its color math from @comfyorg/shared-frontend-utils, and the app-owned pieces that still depend on app stores, i18n, or services: the toast queue store, the loader kit, the App-prefixed wrappers, lazy image, and the value editors for curves, ranges, and palette swatches with their pure interpolation math. Feature-owned files in the same directories stay with their features: settings form fields, system stats, node library tree explorers and bookmark customization, workflow actions, node-search filter chips, credit display, the team-plan credit slider, asset download progress toasts, subgraph breadcrumbs, the execution error overlay, workflow template dialogs, and the node widget adapters WidgetCurve, WidgetRange, and WidgetColors.",
