  "adrs": [],
  "compatibilityPromises": [
    "Unclassified callers may import these internals during inventory; imports from classified domains remain subject to cross-domain rules until a tested public entry point and dependency approval exist.",
    "Component file paths, props, emits, and slots stay stable because extensions, renderer widgets, platform features, and stories import them directly.",
    "The toast store keeps its Pinia id and the add, update, and remove contract used by api, app, and service callers.",
    "Curve and range value shapes stay compatible with the litegraph widget types and GLSL uniform consumers that read them.",
    "No-test holes remain for dialog, field, input-group, label, the select primitives, skeleton, splitter, tabs, button-group, the tab, card, loader, and icon kits, ScrubableNumberInput, StatusBadge, LazyImage, LoadingOverlay, DraggableList, InputSlider, and the divider, spinner, and placeholder widgets; classification does not claim coverage for them."
  ],
  "deepImports": "inventory"
